[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2870711460","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106292#issuecomment-2870711460","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106292","id":2870711460,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rG5Sk","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-12T03:37:50Z","updated_at":"2025-05-12T03:37:50Z","body":"This looks pretty good, but I am a little worried about how complex it is. What was the reason for going with something custom instead of using the approach from Frostbite described in https://seblagarde.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/course_notes_moving_frostbite_to_pbr_v32.pdf (page 72)? \r\n```\r\nfloat computeDistanceBaseRoughness (float distInteresectionToShadedPoint ,float distInteresectionToProbeCenter , float linearRoughness ) {\r\n    // To avoid artifacts we clamp to the original linearRoughness\r\n    // which introduces an acceptable bias and allows conservation\r\n    // of mirror reflection behavior for a smooth surface .\r\n    float newLinearRoughness = clamp ( distInteresectionToShadedPoint / distInteresectionToProbeCenter * linearRoughness , 0, linearRoughness );\r\n    return lerp ( newLinearRoughness , linearRoughness , linearRoughness );\r\n}\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2870711460/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2871697885","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106292#issuecomment-2871697885","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106292","id":2871697885,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rKqHd","user":{"login":"lander-vr","id":31851431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUxNDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31851431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr","html_url":"https://github.com/lander-vr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-12T09:12:22Z","updated_at":"2025-05-27T14:05:35Z","body":"> What was the reason for going with something custom instead of using the approach from Frostbite\r\n\r\nI just built it upon Calinous initial implementation. I found the issues with it were just due to fresnel not being taken into account for roughness, I suspect that frostbite implementation by itself would have the same issue since just that formula by itself would also select a mipmap regardless of viewing angle.\r\n\r\n*Note that the roughness on the floor doesn't match, focus on the ceiling in these comparisons. :)\r\nWithout taking fresnel into account:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7adf6243-3c38-4313-900c-621926429884\r\n\r\nCustom implementation:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0ba60166-2d2d-4392-a467-1135fc9000b4\r\n\r\nCycles (Ignore the floor here, as I forgot to adjust the roughness to match):\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2fa7ea20-4b45-4815-915c-fc78c8b8a009\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/28907ee8-2e39-4503-9565-9f307933da9c)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2871697885/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2874431642","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106292#issuecomment-2874431642","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106292","id":2874431642,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rVFia","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-12T23:19:22Z","updated_at":"2025-05-12T23:19:22Z","body":"Is it planned to port this code to Mobile and Compatibility too (like my original PR)?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2874431642/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2877872903","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106292#issuecomment-2877872903","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106292","id":2877872903,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6riNsH","user":{"login":"lander-vr","id":31851431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUxNDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31851431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr","html_url":"https://github.com/lander-vr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-13T20:32:23Z","updated_at":"2025-05-13T20:32:23Z","body":"> Is it planned to port this code to Mobile and Compatibility too (like my original PR)?\r\n\r\nMobile works already as it runs the same `reflection_process()` function as Forward+.\r\nI do want to port it to compatibility, but I'm seeing some pretty severe issues in terms of roughness behavior in compatibility that make it difficult to validate whether or not this pr is working as intended.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2877872903/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880713264","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106292#issuecomment-2880713264","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106292","id":2880713264,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rtDIw","user":{"login":"lander-vr","id":31851431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUxNDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31851431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr","html_url":"https://github.com/lander-vr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T15:41:32Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T20:44:15Z","body":"Seems like my compatibility issues were project related.\r\n\r\nWorking as expected in compatibility renderer:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5f92cb7f-2334-4a62-914d-ac4ea569d291)\r\n\r\n#### Master:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e275e63a-b767-4eca-8627-4ade6dd28e33\r\n\r\n#### PR:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cf38d5c9-9ffd-4579-aa44-e08f34ecb30e\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880713264/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2966047810","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106292#issuecomment-2966047810","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106292","id":2966047810,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wykxC","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-12T10:24:20Z","updated_at":"2025-06-12T10:24:20Z","body":"Tested, this is a big improvement\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n|--------|--------|\r\n| ![1](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/55e67ca8-1f26-4bd7-b8c2-7d19e1d3d2db) | ![2](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/be1c52c0-6cbc-44d6-aff5-158b03e63980) |\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is cycles pathtracer with _roughly_ the same roughness values for overall comparison, not a 1 to 1:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"400\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/be390801-c778-4cc2-891a-24e854ef1759\" /><br>\r\n\r\nThis is how it behaves with different roughness values in this PR:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ec4fc9d6-0c87-4682-89a5-1b962ee6d056\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2966047810/reactions","total_count":28,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":28,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3003608354","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106292#issuecomment-3003608354","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106292","id":3003608354,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zB20i","user":{"login":"lander-vr","id":31851431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUxNDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31851431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr","html_url":"https://github.com/lander-vr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-25T07:02:39Z","updated_at":"2025-06-25T13:26:41Z","body":"I've done a bit more thinking on this implementation vs. Frostbites, ~~and while I don't fully understand why the frostbite implemenation does `distInteresectionToShadedPoint / distInteresectionToProbeCenter`, as in my understanding this calculation can result in a reduction of roughness as the intersection gets further away from the reflected surface, shown in this drawing:~~\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/459326a0-2c79-4d27-bfd0-cf0c51d17902)\r\n\r\nThe main thing I believe this calculation aims to achieve is make the mip selection relative to the size of the probe: Reflection probes resolutions are static, so the cubemap of a probe of 5x5 meters has the same resolution as a probe of 50x50 meters, so the texel sizes (and in turn the perceived roughness) can vary wildly, the mip selection should take this into account.\r\n\r\nEdit:\r\nI understand now, and it is quite obvious now, values higher than 1.0 don't contribute due to the clamp. 😅\r\nI'll attempt to implement this, though I think our implementation will still be different than what's in the Frostbite approach, since I suspect we will still need that Fresnel approximation to avoid things looking overly rough.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3003608354/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5533864068","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106292#issuecomment-5533864068","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106292","id":5533864068,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSdgQhA","user":{"login":"JekSun97","id":130399274,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8W8Kg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130399274?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97","html_url":"https://github.com/JekSun97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-04T00:21:32Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T00:21:32Z","body":"This would be a great addition to 4.8 as it already adds several graphical improvements!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5533864068/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5587803275","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106292#issuecomment-5587803275","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106292","id":5587803275,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTQ8ciw","user":{"login":"bluesk