had changed the roughness layers count at some point.\r\n\r\n| Forward+ | Compatibility |\r\n| - | - |\r\n| <img width=\"635\" height=\"480\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fcc26900-1ba4-4865-a821-4c071ae8e5f4\" /> | <img width=\"635\" height=\"480\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3a9772da-677a-4df0-82bd-a86db4e044a8\" /> |","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5742235647/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5813469489","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106292#issuecomment-5813469489","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106292","id":5813469489,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWoKBMQ","user":{"login":"lander-vr","id":31851431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUxNDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31851431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr","html_url":"https://github.com/lander-vr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-24T11:47:33Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:20:49Z","body":"| Master | PR |\r\n| - | - |\r\n| <img width=\"1093\" height=\"828\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a0b1972a-e635-4936-a15a-ba1b1e100766\" /> | <img width=\"1093\" height=\"828\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/768c821d-2bad-467e-ad7a-d44929db30e0\" /> |\r\n\r\n\r\n#### A few improvements:\r\nFade contact hardening based on material roughness exponentially instead of linearly.\r\n- We gradually fade out the contact hardening effect as the material gets more rough, but fading linearly removes contact hardening too quickly.\r\n\r\nChanged how viewing angle is influencing roughness:\r\n- Roughness is now adjusted when looking from perpendicular angles while keeping the fresnel at shallow angles, as I found the frostbite approximation over-sharpens reflections at steep angles.\r\n\r\n| before | after | SSR (with probe fallback) |\r\n| - | - | - |\r\n| <img width=\"767\" height=\"767\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0db74336-baf2-44e1-bb57-38e21d2950d3\" /> | <img width=\"767\" height=\"767\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e02acfb6-01c0-4c8c-a81f-e19730e8a166\" /> | <img width=\"767\" height=\"767\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/50a9e1ef-4dc0-418a-bede-068ece8573a8\" /> |\r\n| <img width=\"767\" height=\"767\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/488f7339-4d0b-4c65-863e-f2ac6bbe65bb\" /> | <img width=\"767\" height=\"767\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/27b28ee8-f7f2-4eb0-867f-86ec49e87bc0\" /> | <img width=\"767\" height=\"767\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4c6948d2-5c92-4159-b759-539e4bbec332\" /> |\r\n| <img width=\"767\" height=\"767\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f97fa7a4-efc0-4631-a078-0362b863ac71\" /> | <img width=\"767\" height=\"767\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d60fa47b-6546-4dc6-932f-ad1e5da93b74\" /> | <img width=\"767\" height=\"767\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/24b881ac-50d9-4b68-87c0-3705af286434\" /> |\r\n\r\nHere's a comparison with a roughness of `0.5`.\r\n| linear fading (before) | exponential fading (after) | SSR (with probe fallback) | Cycles comparable scene |\r\n| - | - | - | - |\r\n| <img width=\"903\" height=\"903\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a3795b29-6f2c-43e5-a8b5-2b1a5ccda06f\" /> | <img width=\"903\" height=\"903\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/77b1b7a1-2c3f-4529-bbbc-dbad300aa766\" /> | <img width=\"903\" height=\"903\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d8d7b869-82a0-4965-ab29-3a4fe00c38e1\" /> | <img width=\"903\" height=\"903\" alt=\"26_09_24_13-01_blender_U2KPWNUTFx\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/984bb056-9932-427d-b392-04219872cf87\" /> |\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5813469489/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":3},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5824831735","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106292#issuecomment-5824831735","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106292","id":5824831735,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWy_g9w","user":{"login":"lander-vr","id":31851431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUxNDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31851431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr","html_url":"https://github.com/lander-vr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https